    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a88a57f3901644e8a7a5795b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "感觉……被压倒了……。\n因为大家，都很厉害……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cbc3f40c4218f958bdaeef00bbf72cf175812d8c06b90ffde07edf853854aee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
