    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4a21569a7f636f1720fa755",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "老实说，竞争对手们的力量超出了预期。\n但是，在现阶段\n能知道这一点也可以说是侥幸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5223cdf0d19dd630f9dd1a074ea6634215b491535b9fdfeaea0645a628f38a9f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
