      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "通过最终弯道进入最后的直线，\n在皋月的荣光下闪耀的是哪位赛马娘呢——",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f31f6a99173f58cf7a7816ac54c92347bb3868ca87305f1cf5f804e1f7fcb36",
